  "termsLastUpdated": "Last updated: October 15, 2026",
  "termsIntro": "These terms cover your use of Taiwan Fare Finder (the \"App\"). By using the App, you agree to them. If you don't agree, please don't use it.",
  "termsSection1Title": "Accepting these terms",
  "termsSection1Body": "By downloading, installing or using the App, you accept these terms. We may update them. If you keep using the App after an update, you accept the new version.",
  "termsSection2Title": "What the App does",
  "termsSection2Body": "Taiwan Fare Finder helps you look up, compare and save public transport fares in Taiwan. It doesn't sell tickets, take payments or connect to any operator's booking system.",
  "termsSection3Title": "Fare accuracy and data sources",
  "termsSection3Body": "With API mode on, the App gets High Speed Rail (HSR) and Taiwan Railway (TRA) fares from Taiwan's official TDX open-data platform. MRT, bus and YouBike fares are the App's own estimates, not official prices, and so is the student fare for HSR and TRA. Any fare or travel time can be out of date or wrong, so check with the operator before you travel.",
  "termsSection4Title": "Acceptable use",
  "termsSection4Body": "The App is for personal, non-commercial use. Please don't misuse it or the server behind it, for example by sending large volumes of automated requests, trying to extract API credentials, or interfering with how the App works.",
  "termsSection5Title": "No warranty and limitation of liability",
  "termsSection5Body": "We provide the App \"as is\" and \"as available\", without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including accuracy, reliability or fitness for a particular purpose. To the fullest extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss or damage from your use of the App, including missed trips or fare differences.",
  "termsSection6Title": "Third-party services",
  "termsSection6Body": "Live HSR and TRA fares come from TDX (Transport Data eXchange), the open-data platform run by Taiwan's Ministry of Transportation and Communications (tdx.transportdata.tw). TDX's own terms apply to that data, and we don't control them.",
  "termsSection7Title": "Changes to these terms",
  "termsSection7Body": "We may revise these terms as the App changes. The \"Last updated\" date at the top shows the latest revision.",
  "termsSection8Title": "Contact",
  "termsSection8Body": "Questions about these terms? Email maxfelix05@gmail.com.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyLastUpdated": "Last updated: October 15, 2026",
  "privacyPolicyIntro": "Taiwan Fare Finder has no accounts or logins, and we don't keep any of your data on a server. This policy covers the little data the App handles and where it goes.",
  "privacySection1Title": "What stays on your device",
  "privacySection1Body": "The App keeps your search history, saved routes, cached fares and settings (language, theme, offline mode, data source) in normal app storage on your device. It never uploads any of it.",
  "privacySection2Title": "What gets sent, and to whom",
  "privacySection2Body": "In Mock mode, nothing you search leaves your device. In API mode, the App sends the origin and destination station codes of HSR and TRA searches to our small relay server, a proxy hosted on Cloudflare. The relay passes them to Taiwan's official TDX open-data platform to get real fares. The relay holds the TDX access key, so the key never ships inside the App. It caches fare data for a few hours to stay fast, but it doesn't record who asked. The requests carry no name, account or device ID, because the App doesn't have any. Like any internet request, they reveal your IP address to the networks that carry them.",
  "privacySection3Title": "Analytics",
  "privacySection3Body": "The App writes a few event names to the developer log on your own device, for debugging. It doesn't send them anywhere. If we ever add real analytics, we'll ask for your consent first.",
  "privacySection4Title": "Children's privacy",
  "privacySection4Body": "The App doesn't collect personal information from anyone, children included, and it's suitable for all ages.",
  "privacySection5Title": "Your choices and deleting your data",
  "privacySection5Body": "You can clear cached fares (Settings → Manage offline data) and your history or saved routes (Settings → Data management) at any time. Uninstalling the App deletes everything it stored on your device.",
  "privacySection6Title": "Changes to this policy",
  "privacySection6Body": "We may update this policy as the App changes. The \"Last updated\" date at the top shows the latest revision.",
  "privacySection7Title": "Contact",
  "privacySection7Body": "Questions about this policy? Email maxfelix05@gmail.com."
